# Direct dependencies, as ranges. Edit this file, never base.txt: run
# scripts/lock-deps.sh to recompile the exact pins that CI and deploys install.
#
# Every entry carries a ceiling at the next major (next minor for 0.x, where a
# minor is allowed to break). The lock is what makes installs reproducible; the
# ceiling is what stops `lock-deps.sh --upgrade` from walking across a breaking
# release without someone deciding to.

